# Real credentials, including the superuser password tDB generates on first
# start. Never committed, never packaged. The tracked config.lua holds blanks
# permanently and server/utils/config-loader.js overlays this file onto it.
# Precedence matches the estate: convar > config.local.lua > config.lua.
